\\\"self.health\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"lt\\\",\\\"value\\\":100},\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The chosen resting coordinate is separate from the observed occupied positions and does not claim use of Moss's mat.\\\",\\\"Rest supports energy recovery; companionship is an invitation, not an assumed physical or emotional benefit.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Keep exploration voluntary and preserve a food reserve.\\\",\\\"Prefer tested foods and leave some of the plant's visible stock.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"local-food\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Which nearby foods can support safe, varied meals?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Starting knowledge identifies berries as nutrition 8 and toxicity 0.\\\",\\\"At tick 76, eating one hazelnut produced 18 realized nutrition; the resulting personal observation records toxicity 0.\\\",\\\"Health is 100 after the hazelnut trial; four hazelnuts remain visibly available at tick 76.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Longer-term availability and the properties of other foods remain untested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Maintain reliable food options while preserving room to explore.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Observed the nearby hazelnut plant.\\\",\\\"Gathered and ate one hazelnut as a limited trial.\\\",\\\"Assessed the recorded nutritional and toxicity result.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Personally tested hazelnut nutrition 18 and toxicity 0.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A broader assessment of sustainable supply and other food options.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Keep a modest reserve and share the actual result, then reassess before exploring further.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The tested hazelnut supplied 18 satiety and established a second personally known food option.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

